z0w6103@summa.tamu.edu (WU, ZUOGUO) writes:

>I had a Samurai with a charisma of 3, because he quaffed a potion of sickness
>early in the game. Later (a few days later), he found a potion of restore
>ability (uncursed) and quaffed it, but the charisma wasn't restored. Is this
>a bug? or the stats can't be restored after too long. Anyway it isn't a big
>deal, I am confident this character is going to win the game.

An uncursed potion of restore ability only restores one reduced stat 
(blessed restores all). So if you had another stat reduced (eg: strength
reduced from eating poisonous corpses or quaffing contaminated water
from a fountain), it may restore that stat and hence won't restore your
charisma.

